Description: Provides an end-to-end toolkit for C-QTc analysis, including
    exploratory data analysis, model fitting, goodness-of-fit evaluation,
    and exposure–response prediction. Generates publication-ready tables
    and figures for inclusion in regulatory submissions, supporting
    transparent, reproducible workflows from raw data to deliverables.
